# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# Build context of services/server/images/bothy-postgres/Dockerfile (the repository root).
# BuildKit reads this file instead of a root .dockerignore, so other builds are not affected.
# Everything is ignored except what the image is built from: the sources of bothy-backupd (its
# command and the internal packages it imports) and the scripts of the image. Tests and test data
# never enter the context.
*
!services/server/go.mod
!services/server/go.sum
!services/server/VERSION
!services/server/cmd/bothy-backupd/
!services/server/internal/
!services/server/images/bothy-postgres/entrypoint.sh
!services/server/images/bothy-postgres/check-pgbackrest-version.sh
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
**/README.md
